<title>INDONESIA: Ramayana says 1996 net almost double.</title>
<headline>Ramayana says 1996 net almost double.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twleve months to December 1996</p>
<p>					(in million rupiah unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			  82,408   vs   43,181</p>
<p>    Earnings per share (rupiah)	270   vs	201</p>
<p>    Net sales			  865,604   vs  630,607</p>
<p>    Cost of sales		    616,282   vs  464,525</p>
<p>    Operating income		  97,703   vs   59,765</p>
<p>    Other income			 4,414   vs  (10,486)</p>
<p>Note: PT Ramayana Lestari Sentosa is a department store chain which was listed in Jakarta on July 24, 1996. The results were audited.</p>
<p>-- Jakarta newsroom (6221) 384-6364</p>
</text>
